  "hero_summary_zh": "有莱恩在，敌人反击的机会微乎及微。一排伤人的尖刺能使人头晕目眩，强大的变形术会将敌人暂时变成人畜无害的小动物，就算手中的魔法还不够强大，他和盟友有充足的时间斩落他们的敌人。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Lion gives enemies little chance to retaliate. Stunning targets with a damaging row of spikes, or temporarily transforming them into a harmless critter, even if his powerful spells aren't enough, he and his allies should still have all the time they need to slay their foes.",
