        "scepter_loc": {
          "en": "Finger of Death gains area of effect damage on the initial cast, and increases duration and cleave damage on its subsequent melee attacks.",
          "zh": "死亡之指的初始施法获得范围型伤害，并且后续的近战攻击提升持续时间和分裂伤害。"
        },
